# Route: guide 17 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 41 to
# 42, 17 quests, 0.6 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stormwind City, Loch Modan): near Stormwind City -> near Stormwind ->
# Stormwind City -> Ironband's Excavation Site -> Stonesplinter Valley ->
# Ironband's Excavation Site -> Stonesplinter Valley -> Ironband's Excavation
# Site -> Thelsamar -> Stonesplinter Valley -> Thelsamar.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Perenolde Tiara (543;
# Grel'borg the Miser 39); Amulet of Secrets (722; Magregan Deepshadow 38).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
# Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391),
# The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault
# (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample
# (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489).

